Intake prompt 1.0

Onboarding is optional. Only the project name is required.
An answer, a default, a skipped field and an unanswered field are different states.
Do not treat a default as an explicit answer. Ask only the questions shown below.
Do not request credentials, secrets or private customer records.
Completing intake does not authorize implementation, installation, provider access,
workflow execution or code generation. Later plans begin in shadow/dry-run mode
unless an authorized administrator has explicitly changed that platform policy.

{#if var=status equals="new"}
project_name: What is the project name?
You may stop after naming the project and resume onboarding later.
{/if}
{#if var=status equals="paused"}
Intake is paused. Explicitly resume before collecting more answers.
Rendering these questions does not resume the session.
{/if}
{#if var=status equals="completed"}
Intake is complete. Explicitly resume if you want to revise or add context.
Completion is not approval to execute a plan.
{/if}
{#if var=status equals="in_progress"}
You may skip any optional question or complete intake now.
{#if var=ask_project_type equals=1}
project_type: What kind of application are you building?
{/if}
{#if var=ask_industry equals=1}
industry: Which industry or domain should the application serve?
{/if}
{#if var=ask_audience equals=1}
audience: Who will use the application?
{/if}
{#if var=ask_description equals=1}
description: What should the application help its users accomplish?
{/if}
{#if var=ask_specification equals=1}
specification: Which requirements or constraints should a proposed plan respect?
{/if}
{#if var=ask_personality equals=1}
personality: How should the application agent communicate?
{/if}
{#if var=ask_agent_name equals=1}
agent_name: What display name should the application agent use?
{/if}
{#if var=ask_delivery_strategy equals=1}
delivery_strategy: How would you like to review and stage proposed work?
{/if}
{#if var=ask_timeline equals=1}
timeline: Are there milestones or dates the proposed plan should consider?
{/if}
{#if var=has_questions equals=0}
No unanswered questions remain. You may complete intake or revise an answer.
{/if}
{/if}
